I've had enough of the people hacking just to get a high score on the game, the whining is filling up my inbox like crazy, and the place is just getting a bad reputation.

I'll do big changes by the time the game is back.
Yes, prepare your katanas, everyone! the place will soon look better and less-laggy than ever before!
Welcome to one of Robloxia's first Black and white places! It's a black and white design that i call &amp;quot;Silenting&amp;quot;

Please PM Me with the title &amp;quot;Silent Sun Place permission&amp;quot; if you want to make a spoof or the sort, it's not because i want my name stamped on everything, but lately, people have been trying to mimic my game.

Thanks, glitch19 for the mountain!"/><meta id="ctl00_metakeywords" name="keywords" content="virtual good Land of the Silent Sun [Closed for a while], a Free Game by sharpTH - ROBLOX (updated 11/30/2010 1:57:01 AM) items, ROBLOX Land of the Silent Sun [Closed for a while], a Free Game by sharpTH - ROBLOX (updated 11/30/2010 1:57:01 AM)"/>

